abstract: >-
  ASDS-OMEGA v2.0 introduces Variational Equivariant Causal-Symbolic Discovery (VECSD),
  a unified operator-theoretic framework integrating Multi-Scale Adaptive Variational
  Projection with Hermite Cumulant Errors-in-Variables debiasing (MS-AVP), Variational
  Interventional Flow Causality with Manifold-Aware Faithfulness Guards (VIFC), Model-Free
  Weak-Form Lie-Noether and Foliation Discovery with Reynolds equivariant projection
  (W-LIND), Equivariant Variational Grammar-Guided Hybrid Evolution (EVG-HE), Popperian
  Active Falsification (PAFE), Online Surgical Structural Regeneration (SLR), and
  SymPy/Lean 4 formal theorem certification.
